[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Quick Work]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:10.30]How long had the police taken to find his bicycle? | 警察花了多长时间找到他的自行车？
[00:16.58]Dan Robinson has been worried all week. | 丹·鲁滨逊焦虑了整整一个星期。
[00:20.97]Last Tuesday he received a letter | 上星期二他收到一封信，
[00:23.82]from the local police. | 是当地警察局寄来的。
[00:26.19]In the letter he was asked to call at the station. | 信中要他到警察局去一趟。
[00:30.94]Dan wondered why | 丹想知道为什么
[00:32.54]he was wanted by the police, | 警察要找他，
[00:35.71]but he went to the station yesterday | 但昨天他还是去了警察局，
[00:38.53]and now he is not worried anymore. | 现在他不再焦虑了。
[00:42.18]At the station, | 在警察局里，
[00:43.72]he was told by a smiling policeman | 一位面带笑容的警察告诉他，
[00:46.81]that his bicycle had been found. | 他的自行车找到了。
[00:50.69]Five days ago, the policeman told him, | 警察对他说，5天前，
[00:54.69]the bicycle was picked up in a small village | 那辆自行车是在一个小村里被发现的，
[00:58.35]four hundred miles away. | 离这儿有400英里远。
[01:01.27]It is now being sent to his home by train. | 现在正用火车给他运回家来。
[01:05.61]Dan was most surprised | 丹感到非常惊奇，
[01:08.03]when he heard the news. | 当他听到这个消息时。
[01:10.41]He was amused too, | 他又觉得很好笑，
[01:13.16]because he never expected | 因为他从未指望
[01:15.44]the bicycle to be found. | 那辆自行车还能被找到。
[01:18.36]It was stolen twenty years ago | 那是20年前被偷走的，
[01:21.44]when Dan was a boy of fifteen! | 那时丹才15岁！
